      en: ["Single drop of 221 meters, one of Africa's highest", "Forms the international border between Zambia and Tanzania", "Archaeological site with 250,000 years of human history", "Stands more than twice the height of Victoria Falls", "Critical nesting area for the rare Marabou stork", "Listed on the UNESCO World Heritage tentative list"],
