      en: ["Also known as Sioma Falls on the Zambezi River", "Features a horseshoe shape with a 10-25 meter drop", "Located near Sioma village in Western Zambia", "Formed by water flowing over ancient basalt layers", "Included within the Sioma Ngwezi National Park boundaries", "Crucial corridor for elephant migrations in Southern Africa"],
      es: ["Altura: 10 m", "Anchura: 100 m", "Visitantes anuales: aprox. 5.000", "Altitud: 900 m sobre el nivel del mar", "Superficie de área protegida: 5.000 km²", "Caudal en febrero: 500 m³/s"],
      pt: ["Altura: 10 m", "Largura: 100 m", "Visitantes anuais: aprox. 5.000", "Altitude: 900 m", "Área protegida: 5.000 km²", "Caudal em fevereiro: 500 m³/s"],
